<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
    <defName>ABY_TurretModule_RiftNeedlerCore</defName>
    <label>rift needler core</label>
    <description>Slot: Main weapon. Compatible chassis: Medium. Role: anti-light sustained fire. Effect: gives a modular turret chassis a fast 3-shot rift-needle burst for light enemies, animals, and swarm pressure. Stats: range 28.5, cooldown 2.5s, burst 3, no extra module power draw. Does nothing by itself until installed in a compatible chassis.</description>
